244	    // getRecommendations request is still in flight (isLoading true) and recs has not resolved yet
245	    // (still empty) — gating on `!isLoading && recs.length === 0` (rather than `recs.length === 0`
246	    // alone) is what stops "you haven't viewed anything yet" from flashing during that window.
247	    // Verified directly, not just asserted: temporarily removing the `!isLoading` half of that
248	    // condition in index.tsx (leaving only `recs.length === 0`) makes this exact test fail — the
249	    // empty-state testid renders — and restoring the real gate makes it pass again.
